Amazon's own should not be selling such products.
I bought the product when it was on sale at a reasonable price, and considering the reviews, it’s indeed a very good product.
When I actually received the product, I was stunned: the surface of the item had extensive wear and tear, and there were signs of wear in many other areas as well. It’s either a defective product or an old one; I’ll upload pictures later.
I applied for a return, and the person from the manufacturer said that the issue was caused by transportation after seeing the pictures. Isn’t that just nonsense?
How could the interior of the product get worn out in any way?
There are only two possibilities: either it’s a defective or used product, or I deliberately damaged the item and then returned it for a refund.
Objectively speaking, I don’t have any evidence to prove that I didn’t damage the product. However, considering my shopping history on Amazon, I believe such products shouldn’t be available among Amazon’s own-branded merchandise. When customers choose Amazon’s own-branded products, they are showing trust in the company. When the customer wins, we win; after all, the customer’s success is also the manufacturer’s success. I hope we can all work together to improve the situation. Thank you.
Very satisfied with the watch.
It’s definitely a genuine product; I’ve checked it at the official store. The watch has a beautiful appearance, exquisite craftsmanship, and is made with high-quality materials. Additionally, it features an imported mechanical movement, which gives it significant weight and quality that can’t be matched by those so-called “mechanical watches” that cost only three or four hundred yuan. This one is truly authentic and of superior quality.
The accuracy of the watch’s timekeeping is very high; the error is completely within an acceptable range. The watch comes with a jewelry appraisal certificate in its packaging. The 12 o’clock mark on the dial is made of genuine diamonds. It’s perfect to wear yourself, and it would also make a great gift that impresses others.
The Bentley watches are indeed quite nice.
The stuff’s not bad.
The goods are really good, and I sent it to my girlfriend. However, it was a bit unpleasant when the courier didn't deliver the package during noon when I was not in Canada. The logistics company directly put the package in the parcel locker and didn't send me a verification message to pick up the package. I had to run two times.
But the baby is really nice indeed.
Authentic product, please take good care of the packaging.
The packaging is in good condition; an inflatable bag is included inside. The only difference from the online reviews is that the product doesn’t appear to come in its packaging with just the product itself (without any additional materials or bags).
There is also a layer of plastic wrap on the outer packaging of the bottle, just as described in the picture. The delivery was very fast too; it arrived the very next day after I took the photo.
It is genuine, but it is out of stock and I don’t know when it will be back in stock.
It looks wonderful.
I have been eyeing this camera for a long time, but I did not buy it because of some other reasons besides the price, so I bought it this time because the price was still acceptable and I could get free shipping.
After making the purchase, there were no issues with anything else. However, when trying to connect the device via software, it simply wouldn’t connect. I use a TP router at home. After searching online, I found that many people were experiencing the same problem. I spent over two hours trying various methods to adjust the router’s settings. Finally, I managed to get it connected by using 360WIFI as a intermediary. During that time, I also called Xiaomi’s customer service, but they didn’t have any solutions to this issue and suggested that I contact Amazon for after-sales support.
Another point to note is that I have seen user comments online stating that this camera supports the smallest storage card of 8GB; any smaller and it will not be recognized, so please pay attention to this issue.
It feels good to use it, but the picture quality is still acceptable, but the audio quality is very poor. The machine has some degree of heat generation, and if you keep it on for a long time, it feels like this level of heat is somewhat difficult to accept.
In summary, this product still has many shortcomings, and I hope everyone will be cautious when purchasing it.
Light and large capacity
I like its lightweight design and the large opening. However, the two separate compartments seem a bit unnecessary to me; I don’t really know what to put in them.
After making the purchase, I realized that on Amazon (for overseas purchases), there was another similar product from a different brand for just under two hundred yuan.
Amazon shipping issues
Upon receiving the goods and conducting an inspection, it was found that:
1. The table packaging is in a very poor state of repair (it’s severely damaged).
2. The instruction manual for the table has severe signs of wear and tear from use (i.e., it’s folded or creased due to frequent handling).
3. The clock doesn’t work; the desk lamp can’t be charged, and it can’t be used either. Additionally, it’s impossible to adjust the time.
4. Contact Amazon customer service separately; you will have to pay the shipping costs to send the item to the United States out of your own pocket, and then the additional shipping fees will be reimbursed later.
The reason for the scores of 5 and 2 is that the customer service is quite good.
The first time I bought it, the product had problems, all the lights were flashing and couldn't be used.
I requested a replacement, but even three days after the item arrived in Shanghai, it still hasn’t been delivered to me.
They don’t even answer the phone when you call them to arrange delivery.
The courier company said that they only have that contact information.
Amazon cannot find a place to lodge a complaint.
No request was made; however, in the case of a delayed delivery, they inexplicably delayed the delivery according to my request – and then this kind of message was sent to me.
Then they talked about some transfer issues again.
Anyway, it was a really poor shopping experience, which has made me start to doubt the effectiveness of Amazon’s logistics system as well as its control systems.
Estimate that he won't get it today either.
